meta {
  name: Collector admin
  seq: 3
}

auth {
  mode: basic
}

auth:basic {
  username: {{admin_user}}
  password: {{admin_password}}
}

docs {
  The collector's admin listener, read-only. With a login set on its setup page, put it in the
  environment's admin_user and admin_password; without one, leave both empty. The listener answers
  only the host names in its ADMIN_HOSTS setting.
}
